<> --- SHOPS --- <>

    -- Red --
    Factions | 20 Log
    Dwarf   Gain an isolated pull at the start of the session, draw 1 for every 10 log tokens owned. Must be with Fairy, Elf or Angel.
    Drow    (Once per session, activates during payouts) Losing while all in will not delete your money, but you cannot change your bet when its effect activates. Must be with Goblin, Undead or Hellspawn.
    Merc.   Choose the effects of any 2 factions to use. Must be with Dwarf Drow or Mercenary.

<> --- POWERUPS --- <>

    --Magic--
    Pot of Greed
    MgWrMgWd
    Draw 3 additional cards to your hand

    Mischeivous Manipulation
    MgWdFrWdSlMg
    Shuffle and redeal all cards

    Countable Infinity
    MgIcWrIcMg
    Can play an unlimited amount of powerups this hand.

    Under The Table
    MgThSlGrPnMlMg
    Can play a single PU outside of a time you're allowed to.

    Self Betrayal
    MgFrMgIc
    Can play a PvP-Targeting PU on yourself.

    Wilted Rose
    MgGdFrGrMg
    Cancel the use of a perk this hand.

    Social Media
    MgWdSlGrMg
    Choose the target of the next Whispers you play.

    Froggy Chair
    MgWdFrThMg
    Sit at any color, even if a player is already sitting there. That player will have to move.

    Compressence (Fivepeat)
    Mg2MgMg
    Use this as an infinite amount of one essence during crafting. (Cannot be used for Add/Sub Inf)

    nil
    MgIcGdIcGdIcMg
    Set your hand's value to 0.

    --Metal--
    Add Card
    3e MlWr
    Add 1 to the final CARD's value

    Sub Card
    3e MlGd
    Sub 1 from the final CARD's value

    Suit Push
    3e MlWd
    Final card is next suit (>Fr, Wr, Wd, Gd>)

    Smithing
    3e MlFr
    Final card is Metal suit

    Metal Suit Cards
    2   MlGdMlGd
    3   MlGdMlWd
    4   MlWdMlWd
    5   MlWdMlFr
    6   MlFrMlFr
    7   MlWrMlFr
    8   MlWrMlWr
    9   MlWrMlWrMl

    Clone Card
    MlWdMlWdMl
    Clone the last card in your hand.

    Trap Card
    MlWdWrWdGdMl
    Trash a card and keep it in your hand, you can then play it in the future

    Dynamicard
    MlIcWrMlIcGdMl
    Your last card becomes a DYNAMICARD, which can equal ANY POS INTEGER value up to its current value.
